📌 Project Vision

This project is an astrology-based platform with:
• A React + TypeScript frontend for user interface.
• A FastAPI backend for horoscopes, astrology tools, chatbot, and payments.

It provides:
• General zodiac horoscopes on the homepage.
• Personalized horoscopes (based on DOB, time, and location) on zodiac detail pages.
• Kundli (birth chart generation) and Love Matching features → available after generation, but locked as premium paid features.
• The system integrates astrology APIs, AI chatbot, and monetization features.

✨ Features
1) Frontend (React + TypeScript)
• Responsive UI with modern design.
• Homepage
• Zodiac detail page → Takes DOB, time, and location input and shows personalized horoscope (from backend).
• Integrated chatbot interface for astrology-related queries.
• Calls backend APIs for Kundli, compatibility, gemstones, etc.
• Future: Payment UI for premium features.

2) Backend (FastAPI)
• Horoscopes
• General daily, weekly, and monthly horoscopes.
• Personalized horoscope (DOB, time, location → Kundli-based).
• Astrology Tools
• Kundli / Birth Chart generator (via third-party repos).
• Compatibility & Love Matching.
• Gemstone recommendations.
• AI Chatbot Powered by Hugging Face model -> Answers astrology queries.
• Stores chat history in database. Database should be PostgreSQL.
    • Horoscope requests.
    • Chat history.
    • Payments (future).
• Monetization
    • Free general features for all users.
• Premium features:
    • Detailed horoscope reports.
    • Compatibility insights.
    • Expert chatbot mode.
• Payment gateway integration.

🏗️ Tech Stack
• Frontend → React + TypeScript
• Backend → FastAPI (Python)
• Database → PostgreSQL
• AI Model → Hugging Face (for chatbot & predictions)
• Third-Party Integrations → Astrolog/Kundli repos
• Payments → Decide later (for premium features)

